{"seq":1,"slug":"dosage-forms","title":"大学药学 — 药物剂型与制剂设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/dosage-forms","wordCount":1879,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-药物剂型与制剂设计\">大学药学 — 药物剂型与制剂设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>剂型（dosage form）是药物在使用前经过加工处理后呈现的形态，如片剂、胶囊、注射液、软膏等。剂型的选择直接影响药物的疗效、安全性和患者依从性。同一药物制成不同剂型后，其起效时间、作用持续时间和生物利用度可能存在显著差异。药剂学的核心任务就是根据药物性质、治疗需求和给药途径，设计出最优的剂型和处方。</p>\n<p>核心知识架构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>剂型分类体系</strong>：按给药途径、形态和释药特性分类</li>\n<li><strong>固体剂型</strong>：片剂、胶囊剂、颗粒剂的处方设计与制备工艺</li>\n<li><strong>液体剂型</strong>：溶液剂、混悬剂、乳剂的配制原理</li>\n<li><strong>注射剂</strong>：灭菌工艺、等渗调节和热原控制</li>\n<li><strong>辅料的功能与选择</strong>：填充剂、黏合剂、崩解剂、润滑剂等</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-剂型分类体系\">一、剂型分类体系</h3><p>按给药途径分类是临床最常用的分类方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>给药途径</th>\n<th>常见剂型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>口服</td>\n<td>片剂、胶囊、口服液、颗粒剂</td>\n<td>使用方便，患者依从性好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注射</td>\n<td>注射液、冻干粉针、输液</td>\n<td>起效快，生物利用度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>软膏、凝胶、贴剂、滴眼液</td>\n<td>局部浓度高，全身不良反应少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吸入</td>\n<td>气雾剂、干粉吸入剂</td>\n<td>直达肺部靶器官</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直肠/阴道</td>\n<td>栓剂、泡腾片</td>\n<td>避免首过效应，局部或全身作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透皮</td>\n<td>透皮贴剂</td>\n<td>持续稳定释药，避免胃肠刺激</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按释药特性分类则可分为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>速释制剂</strong>：药物在短时间内完全释放（普通片剂、硬胶囊）</li>\n<li><strong>缓释制剂</strong>：药物在较长时间内缓慢释放，减少给药频率</li>\n<li><strong>控释制剂</strong>：药物以恒定速率释放，维持稳定的血药浓度</li>\n<li><strong>靶向制剂</strong>：将药物定向输送至特定组织或器官</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-固体剂型的设计与制备\">二、固体剂型的设计与制备</h3><p><strong>片剂</strong>是使用最广泛的固体剂型。一个完整的片剂处方包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>辅料类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常用品种</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>填充剂（稀释剂）</td>\n<td>增加片重至可压缩体积</td>\n<td>乳糖、微晶纤维素（MCC）、淀粉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黏合剂</td>\n<td>使粉末粘结成型</td>\n<td>聚维酮（PVP）、羟丙甲纤维素（HPMC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩解剂</td>\n<td>促进片剂在胃肠液中崩散</td>\n<td>交联羧甲纤维素钠（CCNa）、交联聚维酮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>润滑剂</td>\n<td>减少颗粒与冲模间摩擦</td>\n<td>硬脂酸镁（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\% \\sim 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包衣材料</td>\n<td>防潮、掩味、控制释放</td>\n<td>HPMC（薄膜包衣）、Eudragit（肠溶包衣）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>片剂制备的两种主要工艺路线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[片剂制备] --&gt; B[湿法制粒压片]&#10;    A --&gt; C[直接压片]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[原辅料混合]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[加黏合剂制软材]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[制粒]&#10;    B3 --&gt; B4[干燥]&#10;    B4 --&gt; B5[整粒加润滑剂]&#10;    B5 --&gt; B6[压片]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[原辅料直接混合]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[加润滑剂]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[压片]\">graph TD\n    A[片剂制备] --&gt; B[湿法制粒压片]\n    A --&gt; C[直接压片]\n    B --&gt; B1[原辅料混合]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[加黏合剂制软材]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[制粒]\n    B3 --&gt; B4[干燥]\n    B4 --&gt; B5[整粒加润滑剂]\n    B5 --&gt; B6[压片]\n    C --&gt; C1[原辅料直接混合]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[加润滑剂]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[压片]</pre><p>湿法制粒适合大多数药物，可改善粉末的流动性和可压性；直接压片工艺简单但要求药物和辅料具有良好的可压性和流动性。</p>\n<p><strong>胶囊剂</strong>分为硬胶囊和软胶囊。硬胶囊由明胶或 HPMC 制成囊壳，填充粉末或颗粒；软胶囊（软凝胶）用于填充油状液体或溶液。软胶囊可有效掩盖药物的不良气味，且密封性好，适合对空气和光敏感的药物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-液体剂型的配制原理\">三、液体剂型的配制原理</h3><p><strong>溶液剂</strong>：药物以分子或离子状态分散于溶剂中，为热力学稳定体系。配制时需考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>溶解度：可通过助溶剂（如聚乙二醇）、增溶剂（表面活性剂）、pH 调节等方法提高</li>\n<li>稳定性：对光敏药物加入抗氧剂（如亚硫酸钠）；对易水解药物控制 pH</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混悬剂</strong>：不溶性药物以微粒形态分散于液体介质中，是热力学不稳定体系。根据 Stokes 定律，沉降速度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>η</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{2r^2(\\rho_s - \\rho_m)g}{9\\eta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3715em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为粒子半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为粒子和介质密度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 为介质黏度。减小粒径、增加介质黏度都可以减慢沉降。</p>\n<p><strong>乳剂</strong>：两种不混溶液体（通常为油和水）借助乳化剂分散的体系。分为水包油型（O/W，适合口服和注射）和油包水型（W/O，适合外用）。HLB 值（亲水亲油平衡值）是选择乳化剂的关键参数——O/W 乳剂通常需要 HLB <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 8 \\sim 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 的乳化剂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-注射剂的特殊要求\">四、注射剂的特殊要求</h3><p>注射剂直接进入体循环或组织，必须满足严格的质量标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无菌</strong>：终端灭菌（高压蒸汽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121°\\text{C} \\times 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> min）或无菌过滤（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.22</mn><mi>μ</mi><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.22 \\mu\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.22</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li><strong>无热原</strong>：细菌内毒素限量，大容量注射液 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> EU/mL</li>\n<li><strong>等渗</strong>：与血浆渗透压相当（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>280</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>310</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">280 \\sim 310</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">280</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">310</span></span></span></span></span> mOsm/L），可用氯化钠或葡萄糖调节</li>\n<li><strong>pH 适宜</strong>：理想范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\sim 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，避免注射部位刺激</li>\n<li><strong>可见异物与不溶性微粒</strong>：符合药典限度要求</li>\n</ul>\n<p>冻干粉针剂适用于水溶液中不稳定的药物。冻干过程包括预冻（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext><mo>∼</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-40°\\text{C} \\sim -80°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">40°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">80°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、一次干燥（升华去除冰）和二次干燥（解吸去除结合水），最终含水量通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-处方前研究\">五、处方前研究</h3><p>剂型设计之前需要对药物进行系统的处方前研究（preformulation），包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>溶解度测定：在不同 pH 缓冲液和有机溶剂中的饱和溶解度</li>\n<li>多晶型筛选：不同晶型的溶解度和稳定性可能差异巨大（如利托那韦的晶型事件）</li>\n<li>粒径分析：激光衍射法测定粒径分布</li>\n<li>稳定性预测：加速稳定性试验（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40°\\text{C}/75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/75%</span></span></span></span></span> RH）</li>\n<li>辅料相容性：DSC 和 HPLC 方法考察药物与候选辅料的相互作用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为什么硬脂酸镁的用量通常不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>？如果过量使用会对片剂产生什么影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某药物水溶性极差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> mg/mL），但口服给药时需要快速吸收。讨论可以采用哪些制剂手段提高其口服生物利用度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>根据 Stokes 公式，分析影响混悬剂物理稳定性的因素，并提出至少三种提高混悬剂稳定性的方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较湿法制粒压片和直接压片工艺的优缺点。哪些药物适合直接压片？哪些情况下必须选择湿法制粒？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一种蛋白质药物对热和机械剪切敏感，需要制成无菌注射剂。讨论应选择终端灭菌还是无菌过滤，并说明理由。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《药剂学》</strong>（崔福德主编）：国内药学专业核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Aulton&#39;s Pharmaceutics: The Design and Manufacture of Medicines&quot;</strong>：英文经典药剂学教材</li>\n<li><strong>USP-NF (United States Pharmacopeia)</strong>：药品标准的权威参考</li>\n<li><strong>中国药典</strong>（最新版）：了解国内药品质量标准体系</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Pharmaceutical Preformulation and Formulation&quot; (M. Gibson)</strong>：处方前研究方法的实用指南</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>剂型设计是将药物从活性分子转化为可供临床使用产品的关键环节。固体剂型以片剂和胶囊为代表，核心在于辅料选择和制备工艺优化；液体剂型需要解决溶解度和物理稳定性问题；注射剂则必须严格满足无菌、无热原和等渗要求。处方前研究是剂型设计的科学基础，通过系统评估药物理化性质，指导后续处方开发的方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 药物剂型与制剂设计","id":"大学药学-药物剂型与制剂设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、剂型分类体系","id":"一-剂型分类体系"},{"level":3,"text":"二、固体剂型的设计与制备","id":"二-固体剂型的设计与制备"},{"level":3,"text":"三、液体剂型的配制原理","id":"三-液体剂型的配制原理"},{"level":3,"text":"四、注射剂的特殊要求","id":"四-注射剂的特殊要求"},{"level":3,"text":"五、处方前研究","id":"五-处方前研究"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学药学 — 药物相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/drug-interactions"},"next":{"title":"大学药学 — 药物递送系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/drug-delivery"}}